      "writtenOn": "2017-07-06T22:22:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should I change the `-d` to `-l` (for local, installs docker) and `-v` (for virtual/mock, installs vagrant)?\n\nDo we still need the \"print CORD version and exit\" that\u0027s the `-v` param?",
