      "writtenOn": "2017-07-06T22:49:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If I understand the proposal, running with no args will install Ansible and repo and source, `-l` will install Docker as well, and `-v` installs Vagrant as well?  I think that sounds good.\n\nI don\u0027t think we need the old `-v` functionality any more.",
